    "text": "•\tThe article reports on vigils and protests following the fatal shooting of Renee Nicole Good in Minneapolis by an ICE agent.\n•\tThe shooting occurred on January 7, 2026.\n•\tThe Department of Homeland Security (DHS) claimed the shooting was in self-defense.\n•\tPhotos show people gathering for vigils and protests.\n•\tMemorials were set up for Renee Nicole Good.\n•\tThe article mentions the shooting sparked an uproar and heightened political divisions.\n•\tThe article mentions the presence of ICE agents in the city.\n•\tThe article mentions the victim was a 37-year-old woman.",
